                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Tentative recommendation. This is a short casual ADVENTURE game. There are no hidden object scenes. Around halfway through I relied heavily on the compass (map / fast travel) to get to the next spot and know where the next interaction place was. It's not a hard game though, I just kept getting lost. The voice acting is like if they all were auditioning for a meditation CD.\r\n\r\nIt's worth the fun distraction on discount as long as you're all right with no HO scenes.",
